      "content": "Please understand that leaving instead of self-sabotaging is not the way to help your family. The \"stain\" you feel is a projection, not the reality they see when they love you. You can help heal the whole by breaking the shame cycle with love and honesty rather than trying to be the \"failure\" you fear you are to \"let the family be whole.\"",
